\cf0 That narrowness is actually valuable. The UDF has effectively inserted itself into a 
\f1\b 300-metre tube
\f0\b0  with bush beside it. When MoSES starts rearranging the ground underneath groups of five drones, vehicles cannot simply disperse across a parade ground.\
\
\
Government forces had taken up positions outside the estate, where they could shell, threaten and issue ultimatums without technically trespassing. The Elvi had responded by declaring war, then declaring it again with amplifiers. Somewhere during the second declaration, several government teams had slipped through service access under the property and started disabling Shakti security from underneath. Their objective was the Traverse, and the Traverse led four kilometres through the mountain to the Ruined Castle complex.\
The arrangement had several advantages when Eloise built it, chief among them that an army attacking her house would have to know there was a secret railway station under it.\
